"Vous avez des modifications de déploiement non enregistrées. Voulez-vous "
"vraiment quitter cette page ?"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:490
msgid "Deployment changes are not saved yet."
msgstr "Les modifications de déploiement ne sont pas encore enregistrées."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:491
#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:568
msgid "Save deployment"
msgstr "Enregistrer le déploiement"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:494
msgid "Widget availability"
msgstr "Disponibilité du widget"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:495
msgid "Enable the widget"
msgstr "Activer le widget"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:495
msgid ""
"Turn this off to pause the WordPress embed without changing your DocsBot bot."
msgstr ""
"Désactivez cette option pour mettre en pause l’intégration WordPress sans "
"modifier votre bot DocsBot."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:498
msgid "Only show on URL prefixes"
msgstr "Afficher uniquement sur les préfixes d’URL"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:500
msgid ""
"One path prefix per line. These control placement, not authorization; use the"
" Audience controls below to protect access."
msgstr ""
"Un préfixe de chemin par ligne. Ils contrôlent l’emplacement, pas "
"l’autorisation ; utilisez les options d’audience ci-dessous pour protéger "
"l’accès."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:503
msgid "Never show on URL prefixes"
msgstr "Ne jamais afficher sur les préfixes d’URL"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:505
msgid "Exclusions always win over inclusions."
msgstr "Les exclusions sont toujours prioritaires sur les inclusions."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:509
msgid "Allowed embed domains"
msgstr "Domaines d’intégration autorisés"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:511
msgid ""
"One hostname per line, without a scheme or wildcard. Saved to DocsBot as "
"defense in depth."
msgstr ""
"Un nom d’hôte par ligne, sans protocole ni caractère générique. Enregistré "
"dans DocsBot comme protection supplémentaire."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:516
msgid "Audience"
msgstr "Audience"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:517
msgid "Only show to logged-in WordPress users"
msgstr "Afficher uniquement aux utilisateurs WordPress connectés"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:519
msgid "Allowed WordPress roles"
msgstr "Rôles WordPress autorisés"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:520
msgid "Leave every role unchecked to allow all roles."
msgstr "Ne cochez aucun rôle pour autoriser tous les rôles."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:528
msgid "Membership integration"
msgstr "Intégration d’adhésion"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:530
msgid "Plan, product, or role IDs"
msgstr "Identifiants d’offre, de produit ou de rôle"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:532
msgid ""
"Comma-separated. Leave empty for any active membership; Ultimate Member "
"requires role slugs."
msgstr ""
"Séparés par des virgules. Laissez vide pour toute adhésion active ; Ultimate "
"Member nécessite des identifiants de rôle."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:536
msgid ""
"The selected membership integration is not currently available. The widget "
"will fail closed until it is active."
msgstr ""
"L’intégration d’adhésion sélectionnée n’est actuellement pas disponible. Le "
"widget refusera l’accès jusqu’à ce qu’elle soit de nouveau active."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:541
msgid "Conversation identity"
msgstr "Identité de conversation"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:542
msgid ""
"Sharing identity makes DocsBot conversations non-anonymous. Each field is "
"optional and is sent only after the visitor passes your access rules."
msgstr ""
"Le partage de l’identité rend les conversations DocsBot non anonymes. Chaque "
"champ est facultatif et n’est envoyé qu’après validation des règles d’accès "
"du visiteur."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:544
msgid "Share display name"
msgstr "Partager le nom d’affichage"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:545
msgid "Share email address"
msgstr "Partager l’adresse e-mail"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:546
msgid "Share pseudonymous site user ID"
msgstr "Partager l’identifiant utilisateur pseudonyme du site"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:548
msgid ""
"Review the suggested DocsBot text under Settings → Privacy before enabling "
"identity fields."
msgstr ""
"Consultez le texte DocsBot suggéré dans Réglages → Confidentialité avant "
"d’activer les champs d’identité."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:552
msgid "Private bot signing"
msgstr "Signature du bot privé"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:555
msgid "Private signing is ready"
msgstr "La signature privée est prête"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:555
msgid ""
"The bot signing key was retrieved securely and encrypted on this WordPress "
"server. Visitors receive only short-lived signed tokens."
msgstr ""
"La clé de signature du bot a été récupérée de manière sécurisée et chiffrée "
"sur ce serveur WordPress. Les visiteurs ne reçoivent que des jetons signés de"
" courte durée."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:557
msgid "Signing key unavailable"
msgstr "Clé de signature indisponible"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:557
msgid ""
"Reconnect this bot to retrieve its signing key. DocsBot will keep the widget "
"paused until private signing is ready."
msgstr ""
"Reconnectez ce bot pour récupérer sa clé de signature. DocsBot maintiendra le"
" widget en pause jusqu’à ce que la signature privée soit prête."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:560
msgid "Token lifetime (seconds)"
msgstr "Durée de validité du jeton (secondes)"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:564
msgid "The selected bot is public, so no signature key is needed or retained."
msgstr ""
"Le bot sélectionné est public ; aucune clé de signature n’est nécessaire ni "
"conservée."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:566
msgid "Open bot embed settings in DocsBot"
msgstr "Ouvrir les réglages d’intégration du bot dans DocsBot"

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:584
msgid "The connection is managed through wp-config.php."
msgstr "La connexion est gérée par wp-config.php."

#: docsbot/includes/class-docsbot-admin.php:602
msgid "DocsBot has been disconnected."
